  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "quick_video",
      "help_en": "The transcoding category. The corresponding feature must be enabled. Valid values:\n\n`live_transcoding`: live transcoding\n\n`quick_video`: quick video transcoding\n\n`offline_audio`: offline audio transcoding\n\n`offline_video`: offline video transcoding",
      "help_zh": "所属分类。\n需要开通对应的转码功能，枚举如下：\nlive_transcoding（live边转边播）\nquick_video（quick边转边播）\noffline_audio（离线音频转码）\noffline_video（离线视频转码）",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "category",
      "options": [
        "--category"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "category",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The drive ID",
      "help_zh": "空间id",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "drive_id",
      "options": [
        "--drive-id"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "drive_id",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "9520943DC264",
      "help_en": "The file ID",
      "help_zh": "文件id",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "file_id",
      "options": [
        "--file-id"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "file_id",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "false",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to retrieve the URL of the master M3U8 playlist. This parameter is valid only when `category` is set to `quick_video`",
      "help_zh": "是否获取 master m3u8 的 url，仅在 category = quick_video 时有效",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "get_master_url",
      "options": [
        "--get-master-url"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "get_master_url",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    },
    {
      "example": "true",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to retrieve the playback URL. Set to `true` to return only transcoding metadata without triggering a transcode; the response will not include a playback URL. If set to `false` or omitted, the playback URL is returned. If the video has not yet been transcoded for the specified `template_id`, the backend initiates the process, which incurs value-added service fees",
      "help_zh": "是否不获取播放url。\n如果填true，只会获取转码元信息，并不会触发ts转码，返回的信息中没有播放url。否则会返回播放url，如果此template_id的视频还未转码，后台将触发器转码。\n转码会产生对应的增值服务费用",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "get_without_url",
      "options": [
        "--get-without-url"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "get_without_url",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    },
    {
      "example": "true",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to re-transcode the file. If set to `true`, the file is re-transcoded, and the API returns a `202` response, prompting you to wait and retry. Contact technical support to enable this parameter before use",
      "help_zh": "是否发起重转。设置为 true 时会对文件发起重转，固定响应 202 等待重试。使用该参数前请先联系我们配置开启支持",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "re_transcode",
      "options": [
        "--re-transcode"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "re_transcode",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    },
    {
      "example": "7JQX1FswpQ8",
      "help_en": "Specify this parameter and use the `x-share-token` header for authentication when accessing a file from a share. In this scenario, `drive_id` is ignored. For all other cases, use an `AK/SK` pair or an `access token` for authentication and specify `drive_id`. You must specify either `share_id` or `drive_id`",
      "help_zh": "分享id。\n如果通过分享操作文件，请携带`x-share-token` header鉴权并传递此字段，此时`drive_id`无效。否则请使用`aksk`或者`access_token`方式鉴权，并传递`drive_id`字段。\n`share_id`和`drive_id`两者必须有一个字段赋值",
      "location": "body",
      "name": "share_id",
      "options": [
        "--share-id"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "share_id",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
